cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the software and the source papers listed in SOURCES.md."
title: "BongTheory: BONG formalizations for quadratic lattices over dyadic local fields"
type: software
version: 0.1.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-08-29
authors:
  - name: "BONG Theory contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - quadratic lattices
  - dyadic local fields
  - BONG
  - formalized mathematics
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of principal results from Constantin N. Beli's
  2003, 2006, 2009/2010, and 2019 v2 papers on bases of norm generators,
  classification, representation, and integral spinor norm groups over
  dyadic local fields.
